{"translation":"kjv","osis":"2John","name":"2 John","testament":"nt","title":"THE SECOND EPISTLE OF JOHN","chapters":[{"n":1,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"The elder unto the elect lady and her children, whom I love in the truth; and not I only, but also all they that have known the truth;","br":1,"sp":{"w":[[4,9,"G4245"],[19,24,"G1588"],[25,29,"G2959"],[30,33,"G2532"],[34,37,"G0846"],[38,46,"G5043"],[48,52,"G3739"],[53,54,"G1473"],[55,59,"G0025"],[60,62,"G1722"],[67,72,"G0225"],[74,77,"G2532"],[78,81,"G3756"],[82,83,"G1473"],[84,88,"G3441"],[90,93,"G0235"],[94,98,"G2532"],[99,102,"G3956"],[118,123,"G1097"],[128,133,"G0225"]]}},{"n":2,"text":"For the truth’s sake, which dwelleth in us, and shall be with us for ever.","sp":{"w":[[0,3,"G1223"],[8,20,"G0225"],[22,27,"G3588"],[28,36,"G3306"],[37,39,"G1722"],[40,42,"G2254"],[44,47,"G2532"],[54,56,"G2071"],[57,61,"G3326"],[62,64,"G2257"],[65,68,"G1519"],[69,73,"G0165"]]}},{"n":3,"text":"Grace be with you, mercy, and peace, from God the Father, and from the Lord Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, in truth and love.","sp":{"w":[[0,5,"G5485"],[6,8,"G2071"],[9,13,"G3326"],[14,17,"G2257"],[19,24,"G1656"],[30,35,"G1515"],[37,41,"G3844"],[42,45,"G2316"],[50,56,"G3962"],[58,61,"G2532"],[62,66,"G3844"],[71,75,"G2962"],[76,81,"G2424"],[82,88,"G5547"],[94,97,"G5207"],[105,111,"G3962"],[113,115,"G1722"],[116,121,"G0225"],[122,125,"G2532"],[126,130,"G0026"]],"add":[[26,29]]}},{"n":4,"text":"I rejoiced greatly that I found of thy children walking in truth, as we have received a commandment from the Father.","br":1,"sp":{"w":[[2,10,"G5463"],[11,18,"G3029"],[19,23,"G3754"],[26,31,"G2147"],[32,34,"G1537"],[35,38,"G4675"],[39,47,"G5043"],[48,55,"G4043"],[56,58,"G1722"],[59,64,"G0225"],[66,68,"G2531"],[77,85,"G2983"],[88,99,"G1785"],[100,104,"G3844"],[109,115,"G3962"]]}},{"n":5,"text":"And now I beseech thee, lady, not as though I wrote a new commandment unto thee, but that which we had from the beginning, that we love one another.","sp":{"w":[[0,3,"G2532"],[4,7,"G3568"],[10,17,"G2065"],[18,22,"G4571"],[24,28,"G2959"],[30,33,"G3756"],[34,36,"G5613"],[46,51,"G1125"],[54,57,"G2537"],[58,69,"G1785"],[75,79,"G4671"],[81,84,"G0235"],[85,89,"G2443"],[90,95,"G3739"],[99,102,"G2192"],[103,107,"G0575"],[112,121,"G0746"],[123,127,"G2443"],[131,135,"G0025"],[140,147,"G0240"]]}},{"n":6,"text":"And this is love, that we walk after his commandments. This is the commandment, That, as ye have heard from the beginning, ye should walk in it.","sp":{"w":[[0,3,"G2532"],[4,8,"G3778"],[9,11,"G2076"],[12,16,"G0026"],[18,22,"G2443"],[26,30,"G4043"],[31,36,"G2596"],[37,40,"G0846"],[41,53,"G1785"],[55,59,"G3778"],[60,62,"G2076"],[67,78,"G1785"],[80,84,"G2443"],[86,88,"G2531"],[97,102,"G0191"],[103,107,"G0575"],[112,121,"G0746"],[133,137,"G4043"],[138,140,"G1722"],[141,143,"G0846"]]}},{"n":7,"text":"For many deceivers are entered into the world, who confess not that Jesus Christ is come in the flesh. This is a deceiver and an antichrist.","sp":{"w":[[0,3,"G3754"],[4,8,"G4183"],[9,18,"G4108"],[23,30,"G1525"],[31,35,"G1519"],[40,45,"G2889"],[51,58,"G3670"],[59,62,"G3361"],[68,73,"G2424"],[74,80,"G5547"],[84,88,"G2064"],[89,91,"G1722"],[96,101,"G4561"],[103,107,"G3778"],[108,110,"G2076"],[113,121,"G4108"],[122,125,"G2532"],[129,139,"G0500"]]}},{"n":8,"text":"Look to yourselves, that we lose not those things which we have wrought, but that we receive a full reward.","sp":{"w":[[0,4,"G0991"],[8,18,"G1438"],[20,24,"G2443"],[28,32,"G0622"],[33,36,"G3361"],[50,55,"G3739"],[64,71,"G2038"],[73,76,"G0235"],[85,92,"G0618"],[93,94,"G3408"],[95,99,"G4134"],[100,106,"G3408"]]}},{"n":9,"text":"Whosoever transgresseth, and abideth not in the doctrine of Christ, hath not God. He that abideth in the doctrine of Christ, he hath both the Father and the Son.","sp":{"w":[[0,9,"G3956"],[10,23,"G3845"],[25,28,"G2532"],[29,36,"G3306"],[37,40,"G3361"],[41,43,"G1722"],[48,56,"G1322"],[60,66,"G5547"],[68,72,"G2192"],[73,76,"G3756"],[77,80,"G2316"],[90,97,"G3306"],[98,100,"G1722"],[105,113,"G1322"],[117,123,"G5547"],[125,127,"G3778"],[128,132,"G2192"],[133,137,"G2532"],[142,148,"G3962"],[149,152,"G2532"],[157,160,"G5207"]]}},{"n":10,"text":"If there come any unto you, and bring not this doctrine, receive him not into your house, neither bid him God speed:","sp":{"w":[[0,2,"G1487"],[9,13,"G2064"],[14,17,"G5100"],[18,22,"G4314"],[23,26,"G5209"],[28,31,"G2532"],[32,37,"G5342"],[38,41,"G3756"],[42,46,"G3778"],[47,55,"G1322"],[57,64,"G2983"],[65,68,"G0846"],[69,72,"G3361"],[73,77,"G1519"],[83,88,"G3614"],[90,97,"G3361"],[98,101,"G3004"],[102,105,"G0846"],[110,115,"G5463"]],"add":[[78,82]]}},{"n":11,"text":"For he that biddeth him God speed is partaker of his evil deeds.","sp":{"w":[[0,3,"G1063"],[12,19,"G3004"],[20,23,"G0846"],[28,33,"G5463"],[37,45,"G2841"],[46,48,"G2041"],[49,52,"G0846"],[53,57,"G4190"],[58,63,"G2041"]]}},{"n":12,"text":"Having many things to write unto you, I would not write with paper and ink: but I trust to come unto you, and speak face to face, that our joy may be full.","br":1,"sp":{"w":[[0,6,"G2192"],[7,11,"G4183"],[22,27,"G1125"],[33,36,"G5213"],[40,45,"G1014"],[46,49,"G3756"],[56,60,"G1223"],[61,66,"G5489"],[67,70,"G2532"],[71,74,"G3188"],[76,79,"G0235"],[82,87,"G1679"],[91,95,"G2064"],[96,100,"G4314"],[101,104,"G5209"],[106,109,"G2532"],[110,115,"G2980"],[116,120,"G4750"],[121,123,"G4314"],[124,128,"G4750"],[130,134,"G2443"],[135,138,"G2257"],[139,142,"G5479"],[147,149,"G5600"],[150,154,"G4137"]],"add":[[50,55]]}},{"n":13,"text":"The children of thy elect sister greet thee. Amen.","sp":{"w":[[4,12,"G5043"],[13,15,"G0079"],[16,19,"G4675"],[20,25,"G1588"],[26,32,"G0079"],[33,38,"G0782"],[39,43,"G4571"],[45,49,"G0281"]]}}]}]}
